  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the tired boss scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the scene where the Black man with a weary expression is depicted as the 'tired boss'. The meme uses the visual of the man to represent the user's own feelings of exhaustion and frustration with social media dynamics, particularly the perceived over-sensitivity of 'snowflakes'. The text 'i'm tired boss' directly addresses the user, implying that the user identifies with the man's emotional state and role. This projection is reinforced by the overall intent of the meme, which frames the user's experience as one of being overwhelmed by online social conflicts.",
